radiationPlates.rea
-3                     spatial dimension
1                     number of fields
#========================================================
#
#    Two parallel square plates, large aspect ratio (plate
#    width / gap = 40) to approximate the infinite-parallel-
#    plate limit assumed by the paper's analytical formula
#    (Kirk/Yuan et al., Eq. 11 -- no view-factor term, i.e.
#    F_12 -> 1). Hot plate at z=0, cold plate at z=1, four
#    side walls (x=0,x=1,y=0,y=1) at the hot/cold mean.
#
#    Numeric BC labels (1,2,3): an explicit boundaryTypeMap on
#    [FLUID VELOCITY]/[SCALAR TEMPERATURE] disables nekRS's
#    CBC-label auto-import of boundary IDs, so genbox needs to
#    write the IDs directly (see tall_cavity.usr for the actual
#    fix this requires).
#
#========================================================
#
Box
-10 -10 -1          nelx,nely,nelz for Box
0 40 1               x0 x1 ratio
0 40 1               y0 y1 ratio
0 1 1               z0 z1 ratio
3  ,3  ,3  ,3  ,1  ,2     BCs (3 characters each!)
